msgstr "On your Apple Account page, open <b>Sign-In and Security</b> › <b>App-Specific Passwords</b>, click <b>+</b>, name it “Covalence” and copy the code <tt>xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx</tt>. Two-factor authentication must be on."

